{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42748","headline":"晚楼寓怀 · 刘兼","name":"晚楼寓怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"薄暮疎林宿鸟还，倚楼垂袂复凭栏。\n月沈江底珠轮净，云锁峰头玉叶寒。\n刘毅暂贫虽壮志，冯唐将老自低颜。\n无言独对秋风立，拟把朝簪换钓竿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42748.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42748","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}